Muse audit-triage integration, generated by muse-github-setup.

The workflow uses anthropics/claude-code-action with Meta Muse. This action is
official Anthropic software; the non-Claude model integration is documented by
Meta and is not supported by Anthropic.
The selected model is Muse Spark 1.3 Contributor (muse-spark-1.3-contributor).
The contributor tier allows Meta to train on submitted content.

Preserve the repository's approved model and data-use choice. Runtime permission
controls are not an operating-system sandbox. The shared runtime helper is
vendored unchanged from the skill's review helper; audit triage has a separate
configuration and does not grant edit permission to PR reviews.

Workflow and helper templates originate in smorinlabs/smorinlabs-skills (MIT).
The audit failure extraction and URL verification behavior derives from the
audit-triage integration in smorinlabs/py-launch-blueprint (MIT).
